<title>USA: MSC Industrial Direct Co Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>MSC Industrial Direct Co Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PLAINVIEW, N.Y. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			    13 Weeks Ended	 26 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>			 Mar 1,	Mar 2,	Mar 1,	Mar 2,</p>
<p>			  1997	  1996	  1997	  1996</p>
